      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I totally agree on this.  I understand that sizing too small or big can break things, but this should be easily fixed with VRChat giving us override options that have a built-in disclaimer that use of sizes outside parameters may cause unintended circumstances and should be used at their own risk.  That would be fine and people would understand if it breaks things that way.  But just because most people are fine with a certain size range doesn't mean that there isn't a significant demand for a larger range of sizes, especially in certain communities and circumstances.",
